# UI & theme

- Colors: `useAppTheme()` → `colors.*`. Tokens in `theme/design-tokens.ts`.
- Light primary `#B8860B`, dark primary `#E6B74A`, light bg `#FFF8E7`.
- Headings: Playfair (`PlayfairDisplay_700Bold` / `_600SemiBold` / `_400Regular`). Body: system font.
- Reuse `GoldCard`, `OrnamentalDivider`, `DiamondDivider`, `IOSToggle`, `ScreenCornerArt` before inventing new chrome.
- Shared layout styles: `theme/screen-styles.ts`.
- Tint silhouette ornaments with `colors.primary` unless the asset is meant to stay full-color (`tint={false}`).
- README screenshots in `docs/screenshots/` are the visual reference for polish work.
- Match existing screen patterns; do not introduce a second design system.
